Subject: [PATCH 22/22] Intranet vhost kurali: prod
 <app>-<ns'-prod'suz>.apps.fw + wildcard.apps...localca; mevcut dosyalar icin
 nginx_intranet_vhost_backfill.yml

- nginx_deployment_spa/3-nginx_configuration.sh: intranet blogu prod'u da kapsar
  (apps.fw, namespace sonundaki -prod atilir, wildcard.apps.garanti.com.tr.localca)
- nginx_ops/nginx_intranet_vhost_backfill.yml + files/intranet_vhost_backfill.sh: mevcut
  vhost'larin server_name/ssl satirlari; app/ns application-confs alias satirindan, flat
  destegi, ad tutmazsa SKIP, sertifika onkosulu, yedek + nginx -t + geri alma, idempotent
- README 4d; testler check_deployment_intranet_vhost (prod dahil), check_intranet_vhost_backfill

